":"https://github.com/skorpnok","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-17T12:22:30Z","updated_at":"2026-08-17T12:22:30Z","body":"Rebased on top of current master (3000096f9aa6f46db98d3a6d2a9442d58cab96ac) and minimally refactored to get rid of redundant variables","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5315969994/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5407221185","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112440#issuecomment-5407221185","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112440","id":5407221185,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQkulwQ","user":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-25T07:51:56Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T07:51:56Z","body":"To test this properly, you will first need to fix the wheel radius in Truck Town. See [Fix truck_town wheel radius - #1347](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/pull/1347).\r\n\r\nI have tested this PR with all the different trucks in truck town, and also tested 4.7.2. This PR seems to fix the problem of the wheel sinking in 4.7.2. There are still plenty of scenarios that will force a wheel into the ground (and I might drop a quick PR to further improve that), but in my testing, this PR is no worse than 4.7.2 in those scenarios, and it is a lot better in the general case.\r\n\r\nI have looked at the code in the one function it changes, but not at all the surrounding code.\r\n\r\n@skorpnok's explanation of the problem with a previous fix makes sense to me also.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5407221185/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5408580653","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112440#issuecomment-5408580653","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112440","id":5408580653,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQmBkLQ","user":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-25T09:46:54Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T09:47:36Z","body":"Just a thought on the remainder of the wheel sinking. I added 4 cylinder collision shapes to the Tow Truck body and set its friction to zero. Each cylinder sits where the wheel would be when the suspension is compressed to its limit. \r\n\r\nThere is now no way of sinking into the ground, and various other issues are resolved also (like when the truck is a significant angle from the ground and so the ray cast is pointing in the wrong dimension and creating ground penetration again). \r\n\r\nThis could be added to Truck Town as an example for people, or documented, or appropriate cylinder collisions could be automatically added to VehicleBody. I have no idea whether this is already a documented and common technique, so just ignore me if so.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"830\" height=\"486\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-25 at 7 34 12 pm\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/01f016ea-841e-42da-b832-4c6ef75a76cd\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5408580653/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]